        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atalia aayór waawutmo Ahasia kaangwí nguwa axás adór na/aywós kura gaás, inós iri tleér na/aá doó waawutmo sleémeero giri hhaamis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Yehosheba dasír waawutmo Yehoramu hho'ór Ahasia, Yoashi garmoó Ahasia guri fís tla/ángw na/aá waawutmowo, kudá' taa ístí tsaát tsu/utaro. Inós nee na/oó umtooro giri lú/ baraá doó qata, as Atalia mingiwa aán, Yoashi iri /úy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoashi nee inós tana alhoót baraá doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ wa ale kudá' kway luú/ kureeri lahhoó'. Qoomaarihe Atalia a waawuto'ór yaamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kurkú faanqw iwa xáy Yehoyada muu guri ya/aáw amór geeraharuuseedár slaqwaruuse nee amór hhay Kari, nee amór xuumuuse, gari ateét baraá doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, gari lo'ór /aymiís baraá doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ wa ale, Yoashi garmaaduú waawutmo Ahasia guri laqán dir'íní ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós giri báy, «Adoorí an adoodá' kuungá' ta tlehha', ti daqooroó tám i qase', nee daqtá wák tidá' dah baraá gadiyeé deelór Sabaátoro, doó waawutmo ngu xuun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daqtidár hatlá' afkú Suri ngu xuun, nee daqtá hatlá' afkú doó alaá do' kuduú alaá xuumuuse ngu xuun, adoorí an adór doó waawutmo kur ló'wa xuunda' as mukuwa gaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daqooroó tsár kudá' baraá balaaqasírí dirií' ar xuuma deelór Sabaátoro, doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngu xune' nee oo waawutmoowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo harweeraak, umuú heewo xooslmoó slaqwara masók gu kón dakose, umuúqo heé naa dirhúngí tseewuy gaasaak. Kuungá' nee waawutmo ti alkoomakonde' qoomár bir ti'imiit laqaá bir darah.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeraharuusér slaqwaruuse sleémeero adoodá' kaa báy nee kaahamusmo Yehoyada gana tléhh, umuú heewo mukós guna ar tláy, kudá' dahá' deelór Sabaátoro, nee kudá' ti'imiitá' deelór Sabaátoro, tari amór kaahamusmo Yehoyadár ohín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamusmo geeraharuuseedár slaqwara gari lawlí haniís nee gaambudaá waawutmo Daudi, kudá' baraá doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i diriiá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xuumuseedá' iri sihhít, umuú heewo i xooslár slaqwarár kón dakose, iimír bihhaá baskú wa ale ay bihhaá /iya awa do'. Kitángw ilahhooa sleeme kuri harweér nee do'o, Waawutmo nguna harweeriyé' bihhe sleémeero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na/aydú waawutmo kunguri tsee/áy duúx, kuri slamaángwí dahaás, nee guri kitaábuú haraa'ayár i haniís ar waawutmo gan'amiis, Yoashi kuri iimbalaáx ar di/i, kuri waáhh tawa waawutmo, muu tsa/i giri slaáhh, tari oó', «Waawutámo sagók fur'a ngu laaleer.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atalia afór xuumuuse nee ar muu ngiwa axás iri daqeér amór mukdá' baraá doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i dirií', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iri qaytsít, waawutmo guri aán aa sihhít bihhaá uhmo adoodá' kus hariím nee geeraharuusér slaqwara nee mukdá' tarumbeétár ufahhaám a tseewúy bihhaá waawutmo. Muu sleémeero ina ló'wa qwalaá/, taruumbeéta kari ufaáhh. Atalia iri /á/, tlabaawós giri feehhamís iwa kat, «Iga saki/é', iga saki/é'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamusmo Yehoyada, geeraharuusedár slaqwara gari báy, «Tsee/áy duuxaak baraá doó Munguhe, ma baraaká' i gaasara' nee heé naa aluusíng wa eeharin bir deer ku gasá' sleeme.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atalia kari óh, kari ar tláy ay dír Afkuduú faras, dír doó waawutmo, kari didií gaás.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy kaahamusmo Yehoyada alqado gari tleéhh tla/ángw AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nee waawutmo nee mukós, as tawa múk AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, slám alqadu gina tleéhh tla/ángw muu nee waawutmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muu sleémeero oo yaamuudá' tana tláy doó Ba'ali kuri feé/, kitangwduú ilahhooa nee murslaaqatudá' taa tleéhh kuri naasúy, Matani kaahamusmoó Ba'ali kuri gaás dír kitangwduú ilahhooa kawa hanmaamisi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamusmo Yehoyada xuumuuse gari qaás as doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kuwa xun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós geeraharuusér slaqwara nee hhay Kari nee xuumuuse, nee muu sleémeero oo baraá yaamu guri ar tláy, waawutmo kunguri huúw baraá doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kunguri dír afkú xuumuusér ar ohís ay doó waawutmo. Iri iwiít gawaá kitángw waawuti'iima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy muu sleémeero oo yaamuudá' iri ló'wa qwalaá/, gixsadá' sleémeero iri tsauúr, alaá Atalia kawa gaás iisaapoó doó waawutmo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
